OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh University principal
OL,4,Aannounces plans to stand down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe principal of the University of
OL,7,FEdinburgh has announced he will not
OL,8,Fseek a third term in the role.
OL,10,FProf Sir Peter Mathieson will stand
OL,11,Fdown in 2028, 10 years after joining
OL,12,Fthe institution from the University of
OL,13,FHong Kong.
OL,15,FHis decision comes just a week after
OL,16,Fstaff represented by the University and
OL,17,FColleges Union (UCU) began five weeks
OL,18,Fof strike action in a dispute over
OL,19,F#140m of planned cuts.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
