OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh University principal
OL,4,Aannounces plans to stand down
OL,5,
OL,6,FMathieson, who will also leave his
OL,7,Fposition as vice-chancellor of the
OL,8,Funiversity, said his time in the role
OL,9,Fhad been a "massive privilege".
